        <value name="version">1.0.0</value>
        <value name="packageName">WmKafkaAdapter</value>
        <value name="description">The Kafka Application enables integration with both Apache Kafka and Confluent Kafka, distributed event streaming platforms designed for high-throughput, fault-tolerant messaging. It allows you to produce and consume messages from Kafka topics, supporting real-time event-driven architectures, stream processing, and data pipelines. With support for Avro serialization format, the connector enables scalable and flexible message handling across diverse systems, providing a unified platform for managing data streams effectively.</value>
